---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import {site,directions} from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Trois regards sur le temps" description="Comparer REVUE, MESURE et ALLURE : trois directions artistiques pour un média horloger francophone."><header class="gallery-header wrap"><a href="/concepts/" class="wordmark">{site.name}.</a><span class="eyebrow">Recherche d’identité / Novembre 2026</span></header><main id="main" class="wrap"><section class="gallery-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Un même média. Trois convictions.</span><h1>Trois regards<br/>sur le temps<span>.</span></h1></div><div><p>Bien choisir une montre.<br/>Avoir envie de la porter.</p><p class="muted">Même contenu, six références, trois écritures. Explorez les accueils et les guides pour choisir une direction.</p><p class="domain-note">Nom provisoire : {site.name}<br/>Domaine envisagé : {site.candidateDomain}, à confirmer.</p></div></section><section class="concept-grid" aria-label="Les trois directions">{directions.map(d=><article class={`concept-card concept-${d.id}`}><a class="concept-preview" href={`/concepts/${d.id}/`}><span class="concept-folio">DIRECTION {d.number}</span>{d.id==='revue'?<div class="preview-revue"><strong>Le goût<br/><em>du temps.</em></strong><img src="/images/leather-480.webp" width="480" height="320" alt="Aperçu photographique de REVUE"/><span>UNE REVUE À LIRE ET À VIVRE ↗</span></div>:d.id==='mesure'?<div class="preview-mesure"><strong>La bonne<br/>mesure.</strong><div class="mini-dimension"><span>Ø 40</span></div><span>DIMENSIONS / MOUVEMENT / USAGE</span></div>:<div class="preview-allure"><strong>L’HEURE<br/>DE VIVRE.</strong><img src="/images/sleeve-480.webp" width="480" height="480" alt="Aperçu photographique d’ALLURE"/></div>}</a><div class="concept-description"><p class="eyebrow">{d.keywords}</p><h2>{d.name}<span>{d.number}</span></h2><h3>{d.idea}</h3><p>{d.description}</p><div class="concept-actions"><a href={`/concepts/${d.id}/`}>Explorer l’accueil ↗</a><a href={`/concepts/${d.id}/guide/`}>Lire le guide ↗</a></div></div></article>)}</section><section class="comparison-notes"><h2>Ce qui change vraiment.</h2><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Comparaison des directions"><table><caption>Trois systèmes visuels, au-delà des couleurs</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Direction</th><th scope="col">Composition</th><th scope="col">Typographie</th><th scope="col">Photographie & mouvement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">REVUE</th><td>Couverture, grille asymétrique, marge de lecture</td><td>Bodoni Moda + DM Sans</td><td>Natures mortes, cadrage et soulignement</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">MESURE</th><td>Établi, filtres, fiches et étapes</td><td>DM Sans + IBM Plex Mono</td><td>Schémas abstraits, gris, états nets</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">ALLURE</th><td>Lookbook, diptyques, alternance clair / bordeaux</td><td>Barlow Condensed + DM Sans</td><td>Montres portées, rapprochements doux</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><aside class="gallery-note"><h2>Une étude, pas encore un média publié.</h2><p>Photographies d’ambiance créditées, données constructeur sourcées, aucun essai revendiqué. Aucun lien affilié actif, aucun achat ni traceur. Les sept pages restent en noindex et hors sitemap.</p></aside></main><footer class="gallery-footer wrap"><span>{site.name} — {site.signature}</span><span>Étude de direction artistique · 2026</span></footer></Base>
<style>
.gallery-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;align-items:center;padding-block:28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.gallery-header .wordmark{font-size:29px}.gallery-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:end;padding-block:65px}.gallery-intro h1{font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,85px);font-weight:450;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin-top:20px}.gallery-intro h1 span{color:#aa3022}.gallery-intro>div:last-child>p:first-child{font-size:25px;line-height:1.4}.gallery-intro .muted{font-size:15px;max-width:43ch}.domain-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);padding-top:10px}.concept-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px}.concept-preview{display:block;height:380px;position:relative;padding:22px;text-decoration:none;overflow:hidden}.concept-folio{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.15em;position:relative;z-index:1}.concept-revue .concept-preview{background:#eae6dc}.preview-revue strong{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:54px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1;display:block;position:relative;margin-top:25px;z-index:1}.preview-revue em{color:#aa3022}.preview-revue img{height:175px;width:100%;object-fit:cover;position:absolute;left:0;bottom:33px}.preview-revue>span{position:absolute;bottom:13px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.1em}.concept-mesure .concept-preview{background:#e8eef4;color:#184bcc}.preview-mesure strong{font-size:45px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.06em;display:block;margin-top:25px;font-weight:500}.mini-dimension{position:absolute;right:42px;bottom:50px;border:1px solid #184bcc;width:155px;height:155px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;outline:1px dashed #91a2b5;outline-offset:14px;font-size:33px;letter-spacing:-.05em}.mini-dimension:after{content:'';height:1px;background:#184bcc;width:210px;position:absolute}.mini-dimension span{z-index:1;background:#e8eef4;padding:10px}.preview-mesure>span{position:absolute;bottom:15px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.09em}.concept-allure .concept-preview{background:#4a1725;color:#f5f0e6}.preview-allure strong{font-family:Impact,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;display:block;font-size:56px;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.04em;position:relative;z-index:2;margin-top:24px;font-weight:400}.preview-allure img{position:absolute;width:70%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;right:0;bottom:0}.concept-description{padding-top:25px}.concept-description>.eyebrow{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted)}.concept-description h2{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:29px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:13px 0 25px}.concept-description h2 span{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;align-self:center;color:var(--muted)}.concept-description h3{font-family:inherit;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:12px}.concept-description>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;min-height:70px}.concept-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:22px;padding-top:10px;gap:0}.concept-actions a{padding-block:12px;min-height:44px;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}.concept-actions a:first-child{font-weight:600}.concept-preview img{transition:transform .5s}.concept-preview:hover img{transform:scale(1.025)}.comparison-notes{padding-block:70px 25px}.comparison-notes h2{font-size:32px;font-weight:450}.gallery-note{padding:30px;background:#eae8e1;margin-bottom:55px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:45px}.gallery-note h2{font-size:27px}.gallery-note p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.gallery-footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:25px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:1000px){.gallery-intro{gap:30px}.concept-grid{gap:18px}.concept-preview{height:320px;padding:15px}.preview-revue strong{font-size:44px}.preview-mesure strong{font-size:37px}.preview-allure strong{font-size:45px}.mini-dimension{width:125px;height:125px;right:30px}.mini-dimension:after{width:165px}.preview-revue img{height:145px}.preview-allure img{height:180px}.concept-description>p:not(.eyebrow){min-height:100px}.concept-description>.eyebrow{font-size:8px}}
@media(max-width:600px){.gallery-header{padding-block:23px}.gallery-header>.eyebrow{font-size:9px;max-width:16ch;text-align:right}.gallery-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;padding-block:40px}.gallery-intro h1{font-size:53px}.gallery-intro>div:last-child>p:first-child{font-size:21px}.concept-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.concept-preview{height:350px;padding:24px}.preview-revue strong{font-size:59px}.preview-revue img{height:170px}.preview-mesure strong{font-size:48px}.mini-dimension{width:145px;height:145px;right:50px}.preview-allure strong{font-size:65px}.preview-allure img{height:230px}.concept-description>.eyebrow{font-size:10px}.concept-description>p:not(.eyebrow){min-height:0}.concept-actions{flex-direction:row;gap:25px}.gallery-note{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;padding:23px}.comparison-notes{padding-top:50px}.gallery-footer{display:block}.gallery-footer>span{display:block;margin-bottom:10px}}
</style>
